export anchor DarkPastelStyle:
    number: 263
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark pastel
    idea: A soft charcoal workspace of rounded cards where each kind of thing has its own pastel, mint for text, lilac for frames, peach for components and sky for images, so the layer tree and the inspector read by colour and by label at once.
    base: dark
    palette:
        charcoal: #232428, the page and text on every pastel
        card: #2c2d33, the top bar, layer and inspector cards and the style sheet
        cardRaised: #34353c, property cards, the selected layer and Present
        sink: #1d1e22, the canvas well, fields and the tool track
        line: #3d3e46, tree ticks and quiet rings
        ink: #f1f0f5, text on dark
        muted: #b8b7c4, meta and field keys
        mint: #9fe3c6, text layers, the active tool, Saved and focus
        lilac: #c9b6f2, frames, Share, the selected ring and the frame outline
        peach: #f6c3a3, components, people editing and the comment pin
        sky: #a9d4f5, images, the version and the radius card
        butter: #f3e3a0, the Selected pill and the fill card
        guide: #7048c8, the 32 px guide and handle rims
    type:
        One stack, Avenir Next, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, with ui-monospace
        for the frame size. Base 15px at 1.5. The file name is 16px 700, card
        titles 18px 700, layer names 14px 650, values 14px 600 tabular, badges
        and pills 12px 700, meta 12px.
    layout:
        A top card holds a lilac B tile, Canvas · Website redesign over Home
        v3, a centred segmented tool track where Move is a mint pill with icon
        and word and the other tools are icons only, then a 66% chip, three
        pastel rounded square avatars, Present and a lilac Share. Below sit a
        wide left and a 392px right. The left holds the canvas well with a dot
        grid, a lilac Hero pill label, the white Hero frame with a lilac ring
        and round handles, and three pastel status pills under it, mint Saved
        2 minutes ago, peach 3 people editing and sky Version 41. Under the
        canvas the layers card shows a tree, Hero across the full width with a
        lilac Frame badge, a lilac ring and a butter Selected pill, and its
        six children indented in two columns with badges that carry the kind
        word, mint Text, peach Instance, sky Image and lilac Frame, Features
        with a grey Collapsed pill. The right card is the inspector as a grid
        of small raised cards each headed by a pastel tag, lilac Position and
        size, butter Fill, sky Radius, mint Auto layout with Vertical, and
        peach Export with Export Hero. Below 860px the cards stack, the tree
        becomes one column and the tool track floats fixed at the bottom.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between cards, 18 to 20px card padding, 12px between property cards.
    density: Comfortable, a two column layer tree and a two column grid of small property cards.
    corners: Round and soft. 20px cards, 16px property cards, 12 to 14px fields, buttons and rows, full pills for status.
    borders: None. Cards separate by tone and selection is a 2px inner lilac ring.
    shadows: Only on floating things, the comment card and the mobile tool track, 0 8px 24px black at 35 percent.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 2px stroke, 18px, inside pastel badges with the
        kind word. Selected is a circled check, Collapsed a right chevron,
        Saved a cloud with a check, always with the word.
    focus: A 3px mint outline offset 2px.
    tone: Warm and plain, with kind words on badges such as Frame, Text and Instance and pills such as Saved 2 minutes ago.
